    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just feeling overwhelmed though. i've been looking into it and it's the only thing that makes sense. when i'm in deep meditation, i can feel the structure of it. it's like i'm a biocomputational node. i'm not just a human feeling things, i'm actually here to process the excess data of the planet so it doesn't become too much for the collective. how can i optimize my throughput so i can handle the load better?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
